{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:25:33Z","created_by_operation":"op_8510fd2e1f2e475f889e72a7c094f764","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_0633550c31d74b3f5608a8a5176dd50d01a5f9153f6da5d17259870a9c51ca6d","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=workflows","setting":"the-pr-agent/pr-agent@d24b6f36e787 snapshot 80d4ad7ef368be71","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_1dd8a215b30a6783776d25081187ec577799e300320f8fc8c3415989887d3605"],"source_ids":["src_eca5c23f34c858c182cb22116e53b9f3"],"text":"Repository development practice: for local verification, run 'PYTHONPATH=. uv run pytest' from the repo root, which discovers the unit-test suite under tests/unittest; e2e tests under tests/e2e_tests need provider credentials and are invoked explicitly.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:25:33Z","updated_by_operation":"op_8510fd2e1f2e475f889e72a7c094f764"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:25:33Z","created_by_operation":"op_8510fd2e1f2e475f889e72a7c094f764","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_0c0562a4b7ea69a1b4fb73240a06fe56a04021739851f9883684dc7b67566a64","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=skills-patterns","setting":"the-pr-agent/pr-agent@d24b6f36e787 snapshot 80d4ad7ef368be71","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_f024b5152cd29327983be5fd8c09b07872c6765e3952be6d6e3f777ccfd54874"],"source_ids":["src_37f82d16035951cfb0aa4b38872f0ef3"],"text":"When enabled, PR-Agent discovers SKILL.md files under configured paths and injects each skill's name, description, and body into the /review, /improve, /describe, and top-level /ask prompts alongside extra_instructions.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:25:33Z","updated_by_operation":"op_8510fd2e1f2e475f889e72a7c094f764"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:25:33Z","created_by_operation":"op_8510fd2e1f2e475f889e72a7c094f764","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_176b920dc593caafc5c5652ba98c8618da11994aad799ff3cd7704e813ce7c13","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=relevance","setting":"the-pr-agent/pr-agent@d24b6f36e787 snapshot 80d4ad7ef368be71","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_2c8a69cd8ce04493cdf15b4eac4d611599854c5c9040b68552d1d3b6bec2d715","slc_9da283d72261997263f945ab8717eadc75d227c89dabaa116e360f7802fafe1f","slc_aaa56cb1a2f424008174fe41b5a21c6e00a01a03bb1c5d80ee53a5af3c41a0c3","slc_cc2b2d68cf35eb292c957bfe9e0c02624a24808f5ec5e26f670ad221613d3e66"],"source_ids":["src_eca5c23f34c858c182cb22116e53b9f3"],"text":"PR-Agent is an open-source, AI-powered code review agent donated by Qodo to the community; it is distinct from Qodo's primary commercial offering and now lives in the PR-Agent GitHub org with an external maintainer.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:25:33Z","updated_by_operation":"op_8510fd2e1f2e475f889e72a7c094f764"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:25:33Z","created_by_operation":"op_8510fd2e1f2e475f889e72a7c094f764","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_1813c09faa7dd08f082d74dceb9c06b2709f075e7186a5162c470f0a7d67c70f","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=interfaces","setting":"the-pr-agent/pr-agent@d24b6f36e787 snapshot 80d4ad7ef368be71","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_847bb64dd7d870e95a5519bf0bb4c6abe64ea302b08b07a97ba8fc97ca2c4e37"],"source_ids":["src_eca5c23f34c858c182cb22116e53b9f3"],"text":"The product can run as a GitHub Action triggered on pull_request opened/synchronize events, configured via a workflow file that supplies OPENAI_KEY and GITHUB_TOKEN secrets.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:25:33Z","updated_by_operation":"op_8510fd2e1f2e475f889e72a7c094f764"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:25:33Z","created_by_operation":"op_8510fd2e1f2e475f889e72a7c094f764","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_1f642a8b20b4c16442496d356e6c8b9a98f08ce6e6b1c36742583cec868cf31b","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=tools-permissions","setting":"the-pr-agent/pr-agent@d24b6f36e787 snapshot 80d4ad7ef368be71","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_15ed15fc5bf68ecf97b65ed0fc0f3a19655e5cb314341794a364d734ff2736f1","slc_699c1eef992ce895e21945c632cb1092927b7d1caea0c831e9806b64f2f8f17f"],"source_ids":["src_37f82d16035951cfb0aa4b38872f0ef3"],"text":"skills.paths is host-level only: it cannot be set from a repository's .pr_agent.toml, and repo-supplied values are ignored with a warning, to prevent malicious repos from pointing the scan at sensitive host files.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:25:33Z","updated_by_operation":"op_8510fd2e1f2e475f889e72a7c094f764"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:25:33Z","created_by_operation":"op_8510fd2e1f2e475f889e72a7c094f764","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_3174da958940b56144bf39d271bb895e41d19347e22817c50f622b70d8756acc","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=design-choices","setting":"the-pr-agent/pr-agent@d24b6f36e787 snapshot 80d4ad7ef368be71","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_b546208a295f10dc5655aa3a1cdf3446cd2d5ba540da08e82ed4c37862f4f8e1"],"source_ids":["src_eca5c23f34c858c182cb22116e53b9f3"],"text":"Review behavior is customizable through JSON-based prompting in configuration files such as pr_agent/settings/configuration.toml.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:25:33Z","updated_by_operation":"op_8510fd2e1f2e475f889e72a7c094f764"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:25:33Z","created_by_operation":"op_8510fd2e1f2e475f889e72a7c094f764","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_38688547e6d89331173e2c045c5b354fcf7583b13a8876df055b0b65ea2eed51","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=design-choices","setting":"the-pr-agent/pr-agent@d24b6f36e787 snapshot 80d4ad7ef368be71","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_d3d980e534da1b777f5711f1384f10a0520ce75c7324f364e7af91a06a6e6a27"],"source_ids":["src_eca5c23f34c858c182cb22116e53b9f3"],"text":"Each core tool (/review, /improve, /ask) is described as using a single LLM call, taking roughly 30 seconds at low cost.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:25:33Z","updated_by_operation":"op_8510fd2e1f2e475f889e72a7c094f764"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:25:33Z","created_by_operation":"op_8510fd2e1f2e475f889e72a7c094f764","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_56a80641befb4b89feccbff5575c0bacc1720455b2a25aefdeb61daffc65d8ca","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=skills-patterns","setting":"the-pr-agent/pr-agent@d24b6f36e787 snapshot 80d4ad7ef368be71","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_1337e55247b25eaee62e71a911bcb620f4804d908f9e81cdc3478e050e85521e","slc_a60dec23bf880be31cbff6070bd627c954d89d955c38786f33a35fc96782de60"],"source_ids":["src_37f82d16035951cfb0aa4b38872f0ef3"],"text":"Agent Skills use a SKILL.md format: a directory with a markdown file whose YAML frontmatter carries name and description, followed by a markdown body of review guidance.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:25:33Z","updated_by_operation":"op_8510fd2e1f2e475f889e72a7c094f764"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:25:33Z","created_by_operation":"op_8510fd2e1f2e475f889e72a7c094f764","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_5d2a7d1e95113ebcbe914a5e8a694f4624d007c914b54c5939dc2ebe42da071c","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=limitations","setting":"the-pr-agent/pr-agent@d24b6f36e787 snapshot 80d4ad7ef368be71","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_660f0cc55627c96dc8c1b44df4371921748c125f75e16bf39410084a8dd74b59","slc_e207371e21bbd9ab5e7dfacdd901b9fbcab407cb598c9fd00625ceaa8c987b7f"],"source_ids":["src_37f82d16035951cfb0aa4b38872f0ef3"],"text":"Because PR-Agent makes single-shot model calls with no tool-use loop, the agent-skills progressive-disclosure model is not implementable; all enabled skill text is loaded into every prompt (bounded by max_skills_tokens), and skills needing script execution or binary assets will not work.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:25:33Z","updated_by_operation":"op_8510fd2e1f2e475f889e72a7c094f764"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:25:33Z","created_by_operation":"op_8510fd2e1f2e475f889e72a7c094f764","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_857d53436936acd1bba85e66c6715e19a72907a4b60e5e8072d02c79fb020be7","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=interfaces","setting":"the-pr-agent/pr-agent@d24b6f36e787 snapshot 80d4ad7ef368be71","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_695b688db51ffa1ee153c2e5564296625f2e710704d67a25384c7d3386576f4d","slc_a0d0f10bb6d22b3fa0bee1c405ea0c6575b76e386e037b1903915e4ec747b358"],"source_ids":["src_235fd772cca85b48a4cce9c4487ae92b"],"text":"A /help command lets users ask natural-language questions in a PR comment, and the bot responds with an answer including relevant documentation links.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:25:33Z","updated_by_operation":"op_8510fd2e1f2e475f889e72a7c094f764"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:25:33Z","created_by_operation":"op_8510fd2e1f2e475f889e72a7c094f764","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_b009da95f3270b7a6a88b3e347cce921fb4c46bcfe1970fd37c83357acdf06da","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=dependencies","setting":"the-pr-agent/pr-agent@d24b6f36e787 snapshot 80d4ad7ef368be71","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_0e67b8903d549f335893111d92b30d5e3455988e11fb44748a11caed7c392c47","slc_a2837a7485d1d77509d66d57ab1a165b1c1cf98e1622cdc20b1deab749a21cdf"],"source_ids":["src_422360faf2ba59efb3a1efe6930de158","src_eca5c23f34c858c182cb22116e53b9f3"],"text":"Docker images for version 0.34.2 and later are published under the pragent/pr-agent Docker Hub namespace; older codiumai/pr-agent tags are a frozen archive with no new pushes.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:25:33Z","updated_by_operation":"op_8510fd2e1f2e475f889e72a7c094f764"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:25:33Z","created_by_operation":"op_8510fd2e1f2e475f889e72a7c094f764","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_b75cb5f2ac81680daf71174d139e8913156e4e0bcd44a9b3a7c48fcbce2a1e0e","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=interfaces","setting":"the-pr-agent/pr-agent@d24b6f36e787 snapshot 80d4ad7ef368be71","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_3ba4529b593fac85b961044204a8f48a960b44b22c8adb3f265ca5c4715b3c0d","slc_b1763d345b3718fc01ae781ccb0bd7087d8de0c76b2d34e383ae9554292ae51b","slc_ffd65d345d88ee7ac0c4c7e438469e2cbd1e5f50194d2f805256d515930f3161"],"source_ids":["src_eca5c23f34c858c182cb22116e53b9f3"],"text":"PR-Agent tools can be invoked by commenting commands like /describe, /review, /improve, and /ask on a pull request, or locally via a CLI such as 'pr-agent --pr_url <PR_URL> review'.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:25:33Z","updated_by_operation":"op_8510fd2e1f2e475f889e72a7c094f764"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:25:33Z","created_by_operation":"op_8510fd2e1f2e475f889e72a7c094f764","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_c09800861b24d85226afdcc851ff75b11e6666b2e9a770c16673083d3d4cd89a","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=interfaces","setting":"the-pr-agent/pr-agent@d24b6f36e787 snapshot 80d4ad7ef368be71","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_212d8a6350b2031473de735c7b81e8ce705e809298ba70a1a0b2798f45c103ab"],"source_ids":["src_235fd772cca85b48a4cce9c4487ae92b"],"text":"The feature matrix lists tools including Describe, Review, Improve, Ask, Add Docs, Generate Labels, and Similar Issues, with per-provider support varying (e.g. Ask lacks Gitea support; Similar Issues is GitHub-only).","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:25:33Z","updated_by_operation":"op_8510fd2e1f2e475f889e72a7c094f764"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:25:33Z","created_by_operation":"op_8510fd2e1f2e475f889e72a7c094f764","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_c36d6b0874ac3b687127139284eb154224f3a739e2d2e09bb467b08b77774e78","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=limitations","setting":"the-pr-agent/pr-agent@d24b6f36e787 snapshot 80d4ad7ef368be71","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_19953e75c7d990e3f8e07a24b0c65dba755d509dbea4132e43470fd1cb5a7dad","slc_beab3fb9c8df8e67de2537019a5a65d9c81f4423a1a6f94ece3ea2c8edaba876"],"source_ids":["src_235fd772cca85b48a4cce9c4487ae92b","src_eca5c23f34c858c182cb22116e53b9f3"],"text":"The /help_docs tool is temporarily disabled since v0.36.1 pending a fix for a credential-exposure issue (issue #2445).","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:25:33Z","updated_by_operation":"op_8510fd2e1f2e475f889e72a7c094f764"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:25:33Z","created_by_operation":"op_8510fd2e1f2e475f889e72a7c094f764","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_ccc0fa8621d7ad72179b1753a5fe6ca5b90df03004fe386b49eab1cb7c1fb1e8","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=interfaces","setting":"the-pr-agent/pr-agent@d24b6f36e787 snapshot 80d4ad7ef368be71","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_0ddbc3b3a994bb8097afca929bce480a80be7083086aa0c2b953bb46283d657c"],"source_ids":["src_eca5c23f34c858c182cb22116e53b9f3"],"text":"The tool is installable via pip ('pip install pr-agent') and run locally against a repository using an OPENAI_KEY environment variable.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:25:33Z","updated_by_operation":"op_8510fd2e1f2e475f889e72a7c094f764"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:25:33Z","created_by_operation":"op_8510fd2e1f2e475f889e72a7c094f764","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_d4ec3b97e2d827b15a60d5ebb8c0728b5319be39278b5e5ff1b5d31af4c381a1","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=design-choices","setting":"the-pr-agent/pr-agent@d24b6f36e787 snapshot 80d4ad7ef368be71","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_a8848554190e7fb9c9d9d2283f82c69df326b79a21f8d99800cce32c7c4d8da9","slc_c3b8d859326cfc94c2f971f6b6416316e778d101556f38f3cac6cc4ade6f55ab"],"source_ids":["src_235fd772cca85b48a4cce9c4487ae92b","src_eca5c23f34c858c182cb22116e53b9f3"],"text":"A PR compression strategy converts code diffs into manageable LLM prompts, and the README claims it handles both small and large PRs.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:25:33Z","updated_by_operation":"op_8510fd2e1f2e475f889e72a7c094f764"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:25:33Z","created_by_operation":"op_8510fd2e1f2e475f889e72a7c094f764","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_f85707b057404a08e08b15c62aaf8f1520fe49896268c867dae993e9e226d554","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=dependencies","setting":"the-pr-agent/pr-agent@d24b6f36e787 snapshot 80d4ad7ef368be71","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_59ed17d748d9823ba61bbbc251a34c97899cd8bfa2d7a83138ac58ac39c102e5"],"source_ids":["src_eca5c23f34c858c182cb22116e53b9f3"],"text":"Supported AI models include OpenAI GPT, Anthropic Claude, Google Gemini, DeepSeek, Mistral, and any model reachable through LiteLLM (e.g. Azure OpenAI, AWS Bedrock, Vertex AI, Ollama).","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:25:33Z","updated_by_operation":"op_8510fd2e1f2e475f889e72a7c094f764"}
